#: ../../source/currently-unhandled_readme.md:40
msgid ""
"This module can be bundled with `browserify`. At time of writing, it will"
" work with native Promises in the Chrome browser only. For best cross-"
"browser support, use `bluebird` instead of native Promise support in "
"browsers."
msgstr ""

